            package manifests, or download-on-first-run mechanisms;

        (2) providing automated testing, scanning, or browser-automation
            capabilities as a service to third parties — whether free or
            paid;

        (3) operating the Licensed Work for the benefit of clients,
            customers, or employers as part of any engagement, paid or
            unpaid — this applies to natural persons and Legal Entities
